' Diagram 25: Network Interface Topology — All IP Connections
' MC-HID-001 §4 / §6
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title "25 — Network Interface Topology\nIP Addressing · Subnets · Port Map  ·  MC-HID-001 §4 / §6"

skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
